OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 12 APR
OL,4,G1100FPaddy McGuinness
OL,5,     GPaddy's live from Salford every
OL,6,     GSunday and he's got another BIG
OL,7,     Gquestion for you. Plus, The
OL,8,     GWeekest Link quiz Paddy's
OL,9,     GTimewarp and your Sunday Dinners.
OL,10,G1300FElaine Paige on Sunday
OL,11,     GDame Elaine's got show tunes,
OL,12,     Gmovie songs, stage news and your
OL,13,     GBreak A Leg messages, plus, we'll
OL,14,     Gbe hearing from a selection of
OL,15,     G2026 Olivier Award nominees.
OL,16,G1500FBob Harris At 80: A Life In Music
OL,17,     GRadio 2 raise a very stylish,
OL,18,     Gvery rock 'n' roll glass to
OL,19,     Gbroadcasting legend, Bob Harris,
OL,20,     Gat 80. Zoe Ball leads the
OL,21,     Gcelebration with Bob and delves
OL,22,     Ginto his milestones and music.
